2026-09-02T00:00:05Z (RFD66606-2172) 'description: When writing prose (code comment, RFD, changelog, README, PR description) in this workspace, state what is currently true of the system. Rule out past-tense edit narration, future or imperative planning, and aging temporal qualifiers.
 # tags: rfd:front-matter
 Text:RFD2172  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-09-02T00:00:06Z (RFD66606-2172) 'tools: Read, Write, Edit
 # tags: rfd:front-matter
 Text:RFD2172  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-09-02T00:00:07Z (RFD66606-2172) '---
 # tags: rfd:front-matter
 Text:RFD2172  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-09-02T00:00:08Z (RFD66606-2172) 'Every sentence of prose in this workspace states what is true of the system now.
 # tags: rfd:hook
 Text:RFD2172  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-09-02T00:00:09Z (RFD66606-2172) 'A reader opens a comment written as history or as a plan and cannot check it against the
 # tags: rfd:intrigue
 Text:RFD2172  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-09-02T00:00:10Z (RFD66606-2172) 'code in front of them.
 # tags: rfd:intrigue
 Text:RFD2172  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-09-02T00:00:11Z (RFD66606-2172) 'Reject a sentence in review when it breaks one of the three habits below.
 # tags: rfd:exit
 Text:RFD2172  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-09-02T00:00:12Z (RFD66606-2172) 'Prose speaks in the tenseless continuous present
 # tags: rfd:details-title, rfd:no-final-newline
 Text:RFD2172  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-09-02T00:00:13Z (RFD66606-2172) 'Every sentence describes behaviour a reader can check against the code in front of them.
 # tags: rfd:decision
 Text:RFD2172  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-09-02T00:00:14Z (RFD66606-2172) 'Three habits ruled out
 # tags: rfd:section-heading
 Text:RFD2172  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-09-02T00:00:15Z (RFD66606-2172) '- Past-tense edit narration ("removed the legacy path"). Git holds history.
 # tags: rfd:section
 Text:RFD2172  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-09-02T00:00:16Z (RFD66606-2172) '- Future or imperative planning ("will add", "TODO"). RFDs and issues hold plans.
 # tags: rfd:section
 Text:RFD2172  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-09-02T00:00:17Z (RFD66606-2172) '- Aging temporal qualifiers ("now", "currently", "previously"). They go stale on the
 # tags: rfd:section
 Text:RFD2172  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-09-02T00:00:18Z (RFD66606-2172) '  next edit, so the sentence should have described a truth.
 # tags: rfd:section
 Text:RFD2172  1 LINE
 Text:Written

